# Picking up the recipe book from the lantern's table by your bunk (#184,
# the Prologue's Scene 2; #206). Played by the RecipeBook prop. You hold it
# up and it's yours: it goes on your toolbar, to read later (select it and
# Use it, wherever you are). It doesn't open here. The lantern, right
# beside it, asks about it. The captain calls from up on deck.

~ start
@hold_up recipe_book
set has_recipe_book
narrator: You got your *Journal*! Small, battered, the corners frayed.
@put_away
@shot by_the_lantern
lantern: What's that?
- (Show him the book) -> shown

~ shown
lantern: Oh! Those look like recipes.
lantern: Are you a cook?
- (Hesitate, then nod) -> a_cook

~ a_cook
set said_a_cook
lantern: Oh!
lantern: Well, that's something!
heron: Come up on deck when you're ready.
@shot free cut
